-1.  **Ray Intersection and Sampling:** Determine the intersection of ray $r$ with the voxel grid bounds. Sample $K$ points $w_k$ along the ray segment within the grid. Calculate $\delta_k$, the distance between adjacent samples $w_k$ and $w_{k+1}$ [S1].
